yield: per-serve
ingredients:
  - item: gin
    mass: 45
  - item: lemon juice
    mass: 25
  - item: sugar syrup
    mass: 15
    note: 1:1 sugar:water
  - item: soda water
    mass: 75
  - item: lemon wheel
    note: to garnish
steps:
  - shake gin, lemon juice and syrup hard with ice
  - strain into a tall glass over fresh ice
  - top with soda water
  - garnish with a lemon wheel
notes: |
  Pairs with breakfast/sourdough-skillet — light, bubbly and hyper-refreshing, the least
  assertive of the four pairings.

  Fresh ice for the glass, not the shaker ice — shaker ice is already half melted and will
  water it down.
